+Validate the initialization gate on the actual complete game JDK17 before using
+the v3 agent. This standalone tiny JVM checks cold classes, an initializer held
+in progress on another thread, successful and failed initialization, native
+health conditions and consecutive-sample resets. Fake GLFW/GL11/resource classes
