+identity, grammar, atomic write and replay guards without a game. The actual
+JDK17 safety script also runs `QaNativeRequestSafetyTest` against standalone fake
+worlds and connections. These fake classes and tests are excluded from the
+agent JAR. This remains private QA instrumentation and is never pack content.
